Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.02,0:00:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,LADY LINDBURG!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you hurt? No, I managed to make\Nit. I'm so terribly sorry. It's my
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.46,0:00:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mistake i should have come with you\Nm 'lady there's no point in having an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.82,0:00:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,escort during my trials for the\Nright to the throne i'm the one who
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.20,0:00:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,insisted on that you are not at fault\Ninez i'm sorry i didn't mean to make
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.94,0:00:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.86,0:00:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Lindbergh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.86,0:00:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Darkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.24,0:00:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us return to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.06,0:00:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Rain would
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.24,0:00:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like to speak with you\Nas soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.88,0:00:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.60,0:01:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.30,0:01:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If my heart comes, I can't take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.78,0:01:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.36,0:01:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I can't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.02,0:01:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I want to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.76,0:01:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will rush with my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.54,0:01:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've spoken with Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.34,0:02:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.74,0:02:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was a Minotaur actually summoned\Nto a city full of people?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.86,0:02:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It resides in the abyss, the\Ndeepest parts of the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.54,0:02:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no doubt, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.08,0:02:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, this is the\Nwork of someone's intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.72,0:02:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.88,0:02:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The source of the summon is\Nthought to be a mysterious
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.20,0:02:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ring found on the corpse of a\Nmerchant lying at the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.60,0:02:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Oaken did his research,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.32,0:02:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he found the magic stone in the ring\Nis of a surprisingly high purity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.32,0:03:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is not something that you\Nwould normally find on the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.32,0:03:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Minotaurs are a threat A-level demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.48,0:03:13.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Normal people cannot simply just buy\Nsomething to trap a creature like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.42,0:03:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to what Okun says,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.30,0:03:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the crest left on the\Nstone indicates the ring
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.48,0:03:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,originates from the\NMagic Empire of Doritis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.12,0:03:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it was Doritis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.06,0:03:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has often provoked us,\Nbut it's different this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.80,0:03:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.84,0:03:33.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He tried to ensure it would work by binding\Nthe princess at the time of the summon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.08,0:03:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, he isn't even trying\Nto get rid of the evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.30,0:03:38.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's troubling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.36,0:03:43.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A plot to assassinate Princess Lindbergh\Nis bad enough, but there seems to be more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.36,0:03:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was waiting for us to initiate a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.02,0:03:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems they want nothing\Nmore than to take what is ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.58,0:03:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our kingdom's prized resource: the\Nrelics of the dungeon of the lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.20,0:04:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then about the man who was\Nable to save lynn's life with a
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.92,0:04:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,single broadsword and in only a\Nfew seconds he defeated a minotaur.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.34,0:04:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Afterwards the secret core followed\Nhis movements but lost sight of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.12,0:04:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They said he disappeared before their\Nvery eyes like some sort of an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.34,0:04:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.78,0:04:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just who is this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.86,0:04:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.78,0:04:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You survived!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.52,0:04:43.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.44,0:04:44.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Survived what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.35,0:04:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't act like you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last night, a giant demon appeared\Nnear the entrance of the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.40,0:04:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a beast like nothing\Nwe've ever seen around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.54,0:04:53.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.46,0:04:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was over by the construction site.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.54,0:04:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since we didn't see you come\Nby after work, I got worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.16,0:05:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.42,0:05:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last night I was being followed\Naround by a shady group of characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.26,0:05:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I ducked and hid and went home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.30,0:05:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.06,0:05:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then why is your face dirty?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.84,0:05:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, I still had to clean\Nthe mud out of the drains.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.12,0:05:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In any case,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.18,0:05:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're real lucky you didn't bump into\Nthat thing while you were out last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.40,0:05:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used to be an A-Rank myself, and if I\Ncame across him, I'd be dead for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.48,0:05:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like the demon was\Nreally something awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.40,0:05:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure glad I only had to\Ndeal with a surly cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.16,0:05:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, what happened to the demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.28,0:05:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it seems it was taken down\Nby a mystery man with a broadsword,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.50,0:05:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,apparently in one blow, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.24,0:05:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.16,0:05:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing there are people\Nout there who take care of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, your payment for yesterday's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.82,0:05:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.58,0:05:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, are you still not trying\Nto get yourself a decent job?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.10,0:05:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A decent job?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.54,0:05:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm already working as\Nan adventurer, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.16,0:05:57.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Nor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.14,0:06:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I keep telling you, you\Ncould earn 30 % more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.58,0:06:04.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need me taking\Na cut of your cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.38,0:06:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have found you. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.24,0:06:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At long last.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.14,0:06:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're from last night? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.84,0:06:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for following you\Naround, but I needed to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.28,0:06:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I used my long-distance detection\Nskill to find out where you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.12,0:06:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I've heard of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.48,0:06:25.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then your job class is listed as Thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.06,0:06:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, my focus is the Magician class.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.22,0:06:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I also have some knowledge\Nof all six skill systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.56,0:06:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.48,0:06:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.39,0:06:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all just at a basic level, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.70,0:06:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually so basic, it's\Nembarrassing telling you about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.06,0:06:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, you can't possibly mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.82,0:06:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, is that him? Can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.14,0:06:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, we've got an audience here, so\Nwould you mind speaking outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.78,0:06:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you do, Nor?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.90,0:06:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.16,0:06:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least nothing that I can\Nthink of to get me in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.70,0:06:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There shouldn't be too\Nmany folks out right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.98,0:07:00.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And plus,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.90,0:07:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my sound-proofing and concealment skill\Ncan keep people from eavesdropping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.96,0:07:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I go with her, or what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.30,0:07:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out there, so that you don't\Nmake any more dumb mistakes. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.28,0:07:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not sure what you mean, but all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.08,0:07:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, are we sure that guy actually exists?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.14,0:07:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the Secret Corps couldn't\Nfind him, how are we supposed to?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.66,0:07:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like they might\Nbe looking for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.12,0:07:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.48,0:07:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can't see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.68,0:07:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do apologize for just\Nshowing up out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.24,0:07:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have confronted you while\Nyou were speaking with the Guildmaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.60,0:07:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, don't worry. That's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.20,0:07:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what is it that I can help you with?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.76,0:07:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to properly give you my thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.00,0:07:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I truly appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.04,0:07:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved my very life last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.88,0:08:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's not just because\Nyou saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.70,0:08:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you did amounts to saving the\Nlives of many others in this nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.50,0:08:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.56,0:08:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your skills are far more\Nimpressive than mine could ever be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.58,0:08:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I think I may\Nhave just gotten in your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.82,0:08:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is simply not true! I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.64,0:08:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine what would have happened\Nto me if you had not rushed to my defense!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.38,0:08:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, um, then I humbly accept\Nyour thanks. Personally,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.26,0:08:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am obligated to give\Nyou as much of a reward as
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.96,0:08:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,possible for your assistance\Nwith what happened last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.82,0:08:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to greatly compensate\Nyou with my deepest gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.60,0:08:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, your gratitude has\Nalready been more than enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.92,0:08:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So can we maybe just\Ncall everything square?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.56,0:08:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.78,0:08:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please let me thank you properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.42,0:08:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My father has also asked to meet you so\Nhe can give you his full appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.64,0:08:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think that's\Ngoing to be necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.72,0:08:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may not look it, but\NI'm a person of status.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.52,0:08:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must give something to the\Nperson who I owe my very life to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.92,0:08:55.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I don't need anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.90,0:09:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there must be something that\Nyou're having trouble with, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.48,0:09:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing that I can think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.66,0:09:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you need, I can even talk to my\Nfather about some territory that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.24,0:09:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.72,0:09:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.16,0:09:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.56,0:09:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.94,0:09:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have an obligation to\Naccept my gratitude. I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.72,0:09:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not move an inch until you\Nare willing to accept my gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.56,0:09:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not leave this spot until\Nyou agree to train me in your art!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.94,0:09:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, look, if I agree to meet with\Nyour father, will that be enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.52,0:09:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great! That's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.32,0:09:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's no need for\Nanything extravagant, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.84,0:09:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, now then, if you'd be so kind, please\Nfollow close behind me. Oh, right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.26,0:10:01.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.18,0:10:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want people to\Nspot us going inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.28,0:10:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'll use my concealment detection\Nocclusion and multiple others to hide us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.62,0:10:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is massive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.24,0:10:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this your house?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.10,0:10:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.02,0:10:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may seem a bit ostentatious\Nand everything, but come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.28,0:10:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I think of it, I'm afraid you\Nstill haven't told me what your name is yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.70,0:10:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. I'm Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.58,0:10:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you, Lord Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.32,0:10:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.36,0:10:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My full apologies!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.08,0:10:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I completely forgot to introduce myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.74,0:10:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Lindbergh Clays at your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.40,0:10:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But my full title can be a little\Ncumbersome and pretentious,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.52,0:11:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I just go by Lind for the most part.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.88,0:11:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you can feel free to just\Nuse that whenever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.16,0:11:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, this is really a spacious house.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.10,0:11:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She must be one of those\Nfancy aristocrats or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.62,0:11:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that you don't make\Nany more dumb mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.78,0:11:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this what he meant?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.18,0:11:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.26,0:11:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.18,0:11:30.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can ask her where\Nmy father is right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.68,0:11:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome back home, Lady Lindberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.86,0:11:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Ines.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.98,0:11:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would like to speak\Nwith my father, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.20,0:11:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is currently in the audience\Nchamber speaking with Rain, m 'lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.32,0:11:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this man with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.18,0:11:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man is my honored guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.00,0:11:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the one who risked his life to\Nsave mine in that attack last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.94,0:11:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are in your debt. Follow\Nme. I'll lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.50,0:11:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She must be the maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.76,0:11:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta be hard to do laundry\Nand dishes in that outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.38,0:12:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She might want to rethink that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.20,0:12:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, she seems super suspicious of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, what's going on Ines? What's all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.48,0:12:23.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why is Lindbergh with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.72,0:12:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I like this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.56,0:12:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who might this man be?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.90,0:12:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Gilbert.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.18,0:12:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now step aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.24,0:12:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This person is an honored guest\Nof Lady Lindbergh. Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.06,0:12:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can only guess if you're\Nhere with Lady Lindbergh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.76,0:12:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you're the one we've\Nall been talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.66,0:12:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.80,0:12:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure don't look\Nlike very much, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.66,0:12:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop being a nuisance, Gilbert.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.14,0:12:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, come along with us to the chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.60,0:12:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more escorts, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.14,0:13:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay. I'll go, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.22,0:13:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doritis is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.12,0:13:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't give a damn about the\Nnon-aggression treaty nor resolving anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.08,0:13:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His previous request made that obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.34,0:13:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you to hand over all\Nthe rights to the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.36,0:13:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I were to lend you my\Nempire's military power,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.22,0:13:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it shall be beneficial for you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.94,0:13:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate such a candid offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.14,0:13:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'd like to avoid the type of proposal
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.08,0:13:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that could result in\Nlosing my entire nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.34,0:13:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There will come a day in your future\Nwhen you shall regret those words.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.14,0:13:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father, that might not be the\Nonly looming threat for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.46,0:13:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then the time has finally come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.18,0:13:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.84,0:13:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, sister. Hello, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.42,0:14:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lynn
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.54,0:14:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is Lynn's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.46,0:14:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lynn that is the hermit's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.06,0:14:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cloak don't tell me you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.96,0:14:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,went back outside the\Ncastle again i needed to go
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.84,0:14:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,find the person who saved\Nmy life myself no matter
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.42,0:14:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What mmm this must be him.\NYes, this is the one who
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.08,0:14:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,showed up and rescued me\Nlast night i'm sorry for
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.20,0:14:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just showing up like this\Nlynn here seemed to be
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.90,0:14:34.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in quite the hurry how you\Naddress does not matter
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.48,0:14:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i do thank you for making the long\Njourney here so you know i'm not
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.80,0:14:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like wealthy or royalty or anything\Nlike that i don't know all the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.50,0:14:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Etiquette and uh so I'm probably\Ngoing to do things wrong. So sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.68,0:14:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in advance. On the contrary, I prefer
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.54,0:14:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to have a real conversation at
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.12,0:15:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,first i would like to formally show\Nmy gratitude without your heroic
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.66,0:15:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,actions my beloved daughter would\Nbe gone forever from this world
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.02,0:15:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i simply cannot thank you enough\Nyou're welcome sire it was my honor
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.72,0:15:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a blessing to get to speak with\Nyou. All right. Gratitude accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.48,0:15:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to hit the bath house and head\Nhome nonetheless. I cannot send
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.86,0:15:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her savior away without some sort\Nof reward huh tell me what you'd
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.30,0:15:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like whether it be land or money\Nit matters not ask and it shall be
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.40,0:15:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yours what is it you desire friend\Nno i don't want anything but thank
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.58,0:15:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you what i see so you have no
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.56,0:15:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,need for money nor land do you fair
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.10,0:15:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough, how about the treasures\Nfrom the dungeon? Our country takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.68,0:15:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,great pride in possessing the\Nworld's oldest dungeon all manner of
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.06,0:15:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rarities have been unearthed and\Nare stored within the treasure hall
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.48,0:15:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can walk through our collection\Nof priceless relics and take
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.82,0:16:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whatever you like that is far too\Ngenerous father i uh don't want any of
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.96,0:16:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That either, hmm. I mean, I don't need\Nany sort of gift at all, your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.68,0:16:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what you have already granted is more\Nthan enough so no treasures either
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.58,0:16:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's see then what can we\Ndo i gotta get out of here
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.00,0:16:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here we go what do you think of this
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.20,0:16:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is that a sword weird a sword it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.94,0:16:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it doesn't look\Nlike much at first glance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.12,0:16:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.64,0:16:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fine, Brain. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.92,0:16:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this point, I'm afraid it has become\Nnothing more than a mere decoration.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.48,0:16:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is far better than just\Nletting it sit here unused.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.88,0:16:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.10,0:16:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.84,0:16:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one will even notice if I\Nswitch it out for the replica.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.70,0:17:00.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.46,0:17:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dang, it's super heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.94,0:17:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure this must be a\Nfamily heirloom or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.64,0:17:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could never accept this from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.92,0:17:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.14,0:17:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I simply stumbled upon\Nit while on a journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.58,0:17:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even remember where.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.00,0:17:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just found it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.74,0:17:28.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's basically a hand-me-down\NWill you at least accept that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.46,0:17:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will make me feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.98,0:17:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, I graciously accept!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.30,0:17:35.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.22,0:17:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good, would you like to\Ngive it a nice solid swing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.06,0:17:38.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.92,0:17:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Physical enhancements.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.76,0:17:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.80,0:17:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is heavy, but not so\Nmuch that I can't swing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.20,0:18:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that, you can wield it one-handed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.04,0:18:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you a strong, sturdy young man?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.76,0:18:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is very kind of you, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.16,0:18:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, about my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.62,0:18:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would like you to teach her some things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.98,0:18:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toughen her up a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.90,0:18:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things are getting perilous out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.88,0:18:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm rather worried about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.38,0:18:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want me to? Gosh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.38,0:18:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can teach her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.92,0:18:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And anyway, it's something she\Nshould, you know, decide on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.12,0:18:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When parents meddle too much,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.76,0:18:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their kids kind of tend to\Nhead in the opposite direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.40,0:18:29.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.32,0:18:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.06,0:18:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sure does laugh a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.18,0:18:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I better hit the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.66,0:18:38.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.58,0:18:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate your time, good sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.28,0:18:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as Lin's father, I\Nhumbly thank you once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.82,0:18:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The heft would be great for training,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.82,0:18:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I kind of feel like I\Nwas given something valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.00,0:18:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait a sec. This sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.90,0:19:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about the same width as the\Ndrain by Auntie Stella's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.42,0:19:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will be great for dredging\Nthe muck out of the sewer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.04,0:19:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try it first thing\Ntomorrow. Sir. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.12,0:19:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.44,0:19:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I won't take\Nmuch more of your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.86,0:19:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.90,0:19:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does she want?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.24,0:19:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First of all, I'd like to\Napologize for my behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.32,0:19:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My conduct was not appropriate towards the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.44,0:19:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,very person who saved\NLady Lindbergh's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.92,0:19:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would like to ask you\Nfor your forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.40,0:19:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.58,0:19:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't need to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.54,0:19:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And please, you should stand up, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.02,0:19:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for accepting my apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.42,0:19:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is my sworn duty to\Nprotect the people of the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.14,0:19:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clays family from all\Ndangers they may encounter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.74,0:19:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you should understand that said duty
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.86,0:19:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,always takes precedence\Nover how I treat guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.54,0:19:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.46,0:19:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you are not Lynn's\Nmaid, after all, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.16,0:19:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.60,0:19:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.00,0:20:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Ines Harness, a member of the\NWarrior Corps for the Clays family.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.36,0:20:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I serve as vice-captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.00,0:20:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like she's a big shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.46,0:20:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From very early in my childhood,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.64,0:20:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have been known as the Divine Shield,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.88,0:20:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as I was appointed as the personal\Nroyal guard of Lady Lindbergh's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.62,0:20:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, that means I am the one\Nwho must protect my lady at all costs,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.76,0:20:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if it forfeits my own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.12,0:20:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since you are the\Nperson who saved her life,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.88,0:20:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it is as though you saved my life as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.22,0:20:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything all that major.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.46,0:20:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.38,0:20:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From here on, I shall help\Nyou in every way possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.80,0:20:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you need my assistance\Nwith anything, let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.70,0:20:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These people are really overdoing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.24,0:20:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, it's all a bit too\Nmuch for me, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.74,0:20:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anything comes up, I'll ask for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.70,0:20:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, let me warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.20,0:20:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Lindbergh may have\Nallowed your attitude,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.86,0:20:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,demeanor, your speech, and behavior,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.34,0:20:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all unpardonable while in\Naudience with the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.68,0:20:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are not permitted to take\Non such a familiar manner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.38,0:21:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.58,0:21:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,should you continue as such, I will no\Nlonger be able to overlook your disrespect.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.16,0:21:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get yourself together, especially\Nin front of the retainers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.78,0:21:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.70,0:21:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I do appreciate the warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.48,0:21:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.40,0:21:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's all I really\Nwanted to talk to you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.70,0:21:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, to whom is it that I\Nfind myself so deeply indebted?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.68,0:21:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would like to have your\Nname, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.68,0:21:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.88,0:21:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.14,0:21:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, did I do something wrong again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.48,0:21:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm sorry. It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.26,0:21:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon, I must be taking my leave. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.80,0:21:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, I ticked her off again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.82,0:21:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is our illustrious hero\Nalready heading home?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.12,0:21:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.54,0:21:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.52,0:21:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.26,0:21:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.18,0:21:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may have heard of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.30,0:21:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Gilbert.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.22,0:21:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Won't you join me for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.58,0:21:59.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would like you to show me\Nthese wonderful talents of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.74,0:22:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.90,0:22:25.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.98,0:22:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.98,0:22:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Je. Me. Je.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.00,0:22:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Part.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.42,0:23:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.50,0:23:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me?

